{"pageid": 806, "title": "Brendan Parker", "revid": 1907, "categories": ["Characters", "Humans", "Children", "Deceased", "Archer's Peak", "Characters (SIKTC comics)"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Brendan Parker</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/e/e3/Brendan_Parker.png/revision/latest?cb=20241215171039\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Brendan Parker\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/e/e3/Brendan_Parker.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241215171039\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/e/e3/Brendan_Parker.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241215171039 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/e/e3/Brendan_Parker.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/535?cb=20241215171039 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Brendan Parker\" width=\"270\" height=\"269\" data-image-key=\"Brendan_Parker.png\" data-image-name=\"Brendan Parker.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Deceased\" title=\"Category:Deceased\">Deceased</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occupation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Student</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cause_of_death\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Cause of Death</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Killed by the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype children (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfY2hpbGRyZW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Archer's Peak Oscuratype children</span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatives\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Relatives</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Parker_Parents\" title=\"Parker Parents\">Unnamed parents</a><p><a href=\"/wiki/Corey_Parker\" title=\"Corey Parker\">Corey Parker</a> † <small>(older brother)</small><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Parker\" title=\"Jason Parker\">Jason Parker</a> † <small>(younger brother)</small><br />Unnamed third sibling †<br /></p></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_9\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 9\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #9</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_10\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 10\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #10</a> <small>(corpse)</small></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote class=\"pull-quote\">\n\t<div class=\"pull-quote&#95;&#95;text\">They already see us! They're already trying to kill us! They killed my brothers.</div>\n\t<p style=\"text-align: right\"><cite>—Brendan Parker , <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_9\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 9\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #9</a></cite></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><b>Brendan Parker</b> was a teenage boy living in <a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak, Wisconsin</a> with his three siblings during the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak incident (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX2luY2lkZW50P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak incident</span> of 2020. While with his family to identify the remains of his third sibling, he and his other brothers were attacked and killed by the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype children (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfY2hpbGRyZW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Archer's Peak Oscuratype children</span>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>Brendan was the younger brother of <a href=\"/wiki/Corey_Parker\" title=\"Corey Parker\">Corey Parker</a> and the elder brother of <a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Parker\" title=\"Jason Parker\">Jason</a>. The boys also had a third, unnamed sibling who was taken and killed by <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype mother (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfbW90aGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">a monster</span>. When their parents were asked to identify the body, Jason requested they \"tag along.\" Once in the parking lot of the school, Jason ran into the woods, with his brothers following after him. Brendan kept a cooler head than the upset Corey, until Corey spotted blood on the ground. <a href=\"/wiki/Tommy_Mahoney\" title=\"Tommy Mahoney\">Tommy Mahoney</a> then burst from the bushes, screaming for the children to run. Brendan began to ask him if he'd seen Jason, only for Corey to then ask Brendan if he could see the approaching monsters. \n</p><p>Brendan then witnessed his brother be sliced in half by the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype children (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfY2hpbGRyZW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Archer's Peak Oscuratype children</span>, before they were surrounded by the creatures. Brendan cried for help, despite Tommy warning him to be quiet, terrified and traumatized by the deaths of his brothers. While Tommy attempted to distract the monsters, Brendan tried to run, only to be speared by an Oscuratype claw and near-instantly killed. Tommy was found by the police holding his body,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC9&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC9-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> but his arrest was interrupted by another Oscuratype kill in the parking lot.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC10&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC10-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Nevertheless, Tommy would be blamed for Brendan's and his sibling's murders.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC15&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC15-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Physical_appearance\">Physical appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Brendan was a young Caucasian boy with light brown eyes and hair.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_9\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 9\">Issue #9</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_10\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 10\">Issue #10</a> <small>(corpse)</small></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"34c497a82b4d704dbbc5556f42c2e4ea\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Brendan_Parker-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Brendan_Parker.png\" title=\"Brendan Parker.png (981 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/e/e3/Brendan_Parker.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20241215171039\" title=\"Brendan Parker.png (981 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Issue #9\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Brendan Parker.png\" data-image-key=\"Brendan_Parker.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Brendan Parker.png (981 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Issue #9\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Brendan Parker.png\" data-image-key=\"Brendan_Parker.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/e/e3/Brendan_Parker.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20241215171039\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_9\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 9\">Issue #9</a></div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<small><div style=\"width:auto; max-height:190px; overflow:auto; padding-left:0.5em; padding-right:0.5em; border-top-left-radius:0.5em; border-bottom-left-radius:0.5em\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SIKTC9-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC9_1-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">Tynion, James IV</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something is Killing the Children</a